Package: parlo
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libasound2t64, libgtk-3-0t64, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0
Description: Offline dictation, translation and meetings
 Parlo turns speech into writing on this computer and never sends audio
 anywhere. The same engine serves live text, captions, meetings and dubbing,
 and the recogniser runs locally once its model is installed.
